1. PROGRAM DESCRIPTION
CapitolAlpha Alerts is a personal notification program that sends market-research alerts, simulated (paper) trade approval requests, position status updates, and related service messages by SMS to individuals who have expressly opted in. The Program is informational; messages are not investment advice, and any simulated-trade activity occurs in a paper (non-monetary) brokerage environment.

2. OPT-IN
You will only receive messages after providing your mobile number and express consent to the Program administrator. Consent is not a condition of any purchase.

3. MESSAGE FREQUENCY
Message frequency varies with market and news activity — typically 0-10 messages per day.

4. FEES
Message and data rates may apply. Check your mobile plan for details. Rome Tech & Threads does not charge for Program messages.

5. OPTING OUT
Reply STOP at any time to cancel. You will receive one final confirmation message. To rejoin, opt in again through the administrator.

6. HELP
Reply HELP for assistance or contact austin.rome@rometechandthreads.com.

7. SUPPORTED CARRIERS & LIABILITY
The Program is available on major US carriers. Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages. Message delivery is subject to effective transmission from your network operator and is outside our control.

8. ELIGIBILITY
You must be 18 years or older and the account holder (or have the account holder's permission) for the mobile number used.

9. PRIVACY
Information collected in connection with the Program is handled per our SMS Privacy Policy (sms-privacy-policy.txt), including our commitment that no mobile information will be shared with third parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes.

10. CHANGES & TERMINATION
We may modify or terminate the Program at any time. Material changes will be reflected on this page with an updated date.

